    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the wonderful world of Efteling. Discover and enjoy the magic of Efteling in this exciting game with well-known characters such as Little Red Riding Hood and the Unnameable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >====Gameplay=== </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Efteling and play fun mini-games to unlock new things</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >==Graphics== </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unreal Engine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >==Story==</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was an ordinary day in the Efteling and Pardoes was just about to open the Efteling until Pantagor got hold of Pardoes and locked him in the Fata Morgana! Now horrible creatures are walking around and the other Efteling shurks rule over the 6 realms! it's your job to save the park!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >===Extra=== </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the fun music of Efteling </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >==end==</p>",
